{
  "info": {
    "name": "FFP - Fit For Purpose API",
    "description": "Multi-tenant physiotherapy assessment and workout programme platform.\n\n**Architecture:**\n- AWS Lambda + API Gateway v2 (HTTP API)\n- Region: eu-west-2 (London)\n- Authentication: Cognito JWT\n\n**Authentication:**\nProtected endpoints require JWT token with custom claims:\n- `custom:tenantId` - Tenant identifier\n- `custom:role` - User role\n- `custom:customerId` - Customer identifier (for users under customer organisations)\n\n**Phase:** Sprint 1 (Foundation Infrastructure)\n**Developer:** Christopher Tregaskis",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health & Status",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health Check",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{apiUrl}}/health",
              "host": ["{{apiUrl}}"],
              "path": ["health"]
            },
            "description": "Public health check endpoint - no authentication required.\n\nReturns:\n- `status`: Health status (\"healthy\")\n- `message`: Service identification\n- `timestamp`: Current server time (ISO 8601)\n- `service`: Service name\n- `version`: API version\n\n**Status Codes:**\n- `200`: Service is healthy\n- `500`: Service health check failed"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Healthy Response",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{apiUrl}}/health",
                  "host": ["{{apiUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["health"]
                }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"status\": \"healthy\",\n  \"message\": \"FFP Functions - Health Check OK\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2025-10-25T12:34:56.789Z\",\n  \"service\": \"auth\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0.0\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "description": "Health and status endpoints - no authentication required"
    },
    {
      "name": "Admin Operations",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create Customer",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "// Validate JWT token is set",
                  "const jwtToken = pm.collectionVariables.get('jwtToken');",
                  "",
                  "if (!jwtToken || jwtToken === '') {",
                  "    throw new Error('JWT token is required. Please authenticate first and set the jwtToken variable.');",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "// Test response structure",
                  "pm.test('Status code is 200', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Response has required fields', function () {",
                  "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('tenantId');",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('customerId');",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('customerName');",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Tenant ID is valid UUID', function () {",
                  "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    const uuidRegex = /^[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{12}$/i;",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.tenantId).to.match(uuidRegex);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Customer ID is valid UUID', function () {",
                  "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    const uuidRegex = /^[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{12}$/i;",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.customerId).to.match(uuidRegex);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"customerName\": \"Sunshine Carehome\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{apiUrl}}/admin/create-customer",
              "host": ["{{apiUrl}}"],
              "path": ["admin", "create-customer"]
            },
            "description": "Create a new customer tenant and customer record.\n\n**Note:** \"customer\" represents a business/care home organisation in the system.\n\n**Authentication:** System admin JWT token required\n\n**Request Body:**\n```json\n{\n  \"customerName\": \"Sunshine Carehome\"\n}\n```\n\n**Response:**\n```json\n{\n  \"tenantId\": \"uuid\",\n  \"customerId\": \"uuid\",\n  \"customerName\": \"Sunshine Carehome\"\n}\n```\n\n**Status Codes:**\n- `200`: Customer created successfully\n- `400`: Validation error (invalid input)\n- `401`: Unauthorised (no JWT token)\n- `403`: Forbidden (not a system_admin)\n- `500`: Internal server error\n\n**Two-Step Onboarding:**\nThis endpoint creates the tenant and customer records. After successful creation:\n1. Use the returned `tenantId` with POST /auth/invite-user (FFP-37) to create the business owner account\n2. Owner will receive Cognito invitation email with temporary password\n\n**Phase 1 MVP:**\nFor Phase 1, all customers are treated the same. Features will be added in future phases."
          },
