      ],
      "description": "AWS Cognito authentication for obtaining JWT tokens.\n\n**Setup Instructions:**\n1. Set collection variables:\n   - `userPoolClientId` - Your Cognito User Pool Client ID\n   - `cognitoUsername` - Your email/username\n   - `cognitoPassword` - Your password\n   - `awsRegion` - AWS region (e.g., eu-west-2)\n\n2. Send the \"Get JWT Token (Cognito)\" request\n3. The `jwtToken` variable will be automatically set\n4. Protected endpoints will use this token automatically\n\n**Future Endpoints:**\n- POST /auth/refresh - Refresh tokens using refresh token\n- POST /auth/forgot-password - Initiate password reset\n- POST /auth/change-password - Change password for authenticated user"
    },
